  "features": [
    {
      "name": "karabiner-ime",
      "macos": true,
      "brew": [
        {
          "name": "karabiner-elements",
          "cask": true
        }
      ],
      "copy": [
        {
          "from": "home/dot-config/karabiner/karabiner.json",
          "to": ".config/karabiner/karabiner.json"
        }
      ],
      "hotkeys": [
        {
          "id": 60,
          "enabled": true,
          "ascii": 32,
          "keycode": 49,
          "modifiers": 1310720
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "enabled": false
        }
      ],
      "description": {
        "en": "Caps Lock as IME switch: tap to switch between ABC and your last-used input method; hold as Control. Left Control held emits Control+Option. Sets macOS 'previous input source' to ⌃⌥Space (⌘Space stays free for Spotlight/Raycast).",
        "zh-TW": "Caps Lock 當輸入法切換鍵:輕點在 ABC 與上次使用的輸入法間切換,長按當 Control。長按左 Control 送出 Control+Option。macOS「選擇上一個輸入法」改為 ⌃⌥Space(⌘Space 留給 Spotlight/Raycast)。"
      },
      "notes": {
        "en": "Installs Karabiner-Elements. After setup you must open Karabiner-Elements once and approve its driver extension and Input Monitoring in System Settings. With three or more input sources, Caps Lock toggles between ABC and the most recently used one.",
        "zh-TW": "會安裝 Karabiner-Elements。安裝後需開啟 Karabiner-Elements 一次,並在系統設定核准驅動程式延伸功能與輸入監控。若有三個以上輸入法,Caps Lock 會在 ABC 與最近使用的輸入法間切換。"
      }
    }
  ]
